       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTOMER-PROCESSOR.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 CUSTOMER-NAME    PIC X(30).
       01 CUSTOMER-AGE     PIC 99.
       01 CUSTOMER-BALANCE PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 STATUS-MESSAGE   PIC X(20).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           DISPLAY "ENTER CUSTOMER NAME: "
           ACCEPT CUSTOMER-NAME.

           DISPLAY "ENTER CUSTOMER AGE: "
           ACCEPT CUSTOMER-AGE.

           DISPLAY "ENTER CUSTOMER BALANCE: "
           ACCEPT CUSTOMER-BALANCE.

           IF CUSTOMER-AGE >= 18
               MOVE "ELIGIBLE" TO STATUS-MESSAGE
           ELSE
               MOVE "NOT ELIGIBLE" TO STATUS-MESSAGE
           END-IF.

           DISPLAY "------------------------".
           DISPLAY "CUSTOMER: " CUSTOMER-NAME.
           DISPLAY "AGE: " CUSTOMER-AGE.
           DISPLAY "BALANCE: " CUSTOMER-BALANCE.
           DISPLAY "STATUS: " STATUS-MESSAGE.
           DISPLAY "------------------------".

           STOP RUN.